								<ul>
									<li>1873 (Meiji 6), Councilor OKUBO's Draft Opinion on Constitutional Government</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="colThumb">
								<h5><a href="description09.html"><img src="/modern/thumb/g_thumb/010-001g.jpg" alt="" width="74" height="74" />1-9<span class="txtlinks">White Paper for Establishment of Popularly-elected Assembly</span></a></h5>
								<ul>
									<li>Aikoku Koto Pledge (Draft)</li>
									<li>Aikoku Koto Appended Pledge (Draft)</li>
									<li>Draft of Petition for the Establishment of a Popularly elected Assembly (three versions)</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="colThumb">
								<h5><a href="description10.html"><img src="/modern/thumb/g_thumb/013-001g.jpg" alt="" width="74" height="74" />1-10<span class="txtlinks">Osaka Conference</span></a></h5>
								<ul>
									<li>Blueprint for Governmental Reform</li>
									<li>Draft Proposal of the Osaka Conference Agreement</li>
									<li>Addendum to the Draft Proposal of the Osaka Conference Agreement</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="colThumb">
								<h5><a href="description11.html"><img src="/modern/thumb/g_thumb/016-001g.jpg" alt="" width="74" height="74" />1-11<span class="txtlinks">Satsuma Rebellion</span></a></h5>
								<ul>
									<li>Report of the Artillery Attack Against (Saigo Forces) in Shiroyama</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="colThumb">
								<h5><a href="description12.html"><img src="/modern/thumb/g_thumb/017-001g.jpg" alt="" width="74" height="74" />1-12<span class="txtlinks">Petition by Risshisha to Establish a National Assembly</span></a></h5>
								<ul>
