							<div class="colThumb">
								<h5><a href="description14.html"><img src="/modern/thumb/g_thumb/020-001g.jpg" alt="" width="74" height="74" />1-14<span class="txtlinks">UEKI Emori's Conception of a Constitution</span></a></h5>
